    {
      "id": "b0002",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "8c803273eb362cea",
      "translationZh": "使用 LM Bionic、张量并行、mtp，最大草稿 token 数为 6，概率为 0.88，采用 q4_0 的 200k 上下文，UD 3.0 qwen 3.8 q4_k_xl",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0003",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "ea9134459d6e14f4",
      "translationZh": "两张 5060 ti（每张 16gb），装在一块采用 AM4 插槽、具有 x16 和 x4 pci 通道的主板上，另有 32 gb 的 ddr4 内存",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0004",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "39168b11fe811360",
      "translationZh": "我给出的提示词是：",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0005",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "89aa9f8ade17e89d",
